--- Optimization Strategy Predictions ---
Based on the multi-dimensional model, optimal strategies per market maturity:

GROWING market:
  - Quality score has negative effect (β=-0.000495) - maintain baseline
  - Reduce crash rate (β=-0.000290): -1 crash → +0.000290 rpad
  - Model R² = 0.2148

STABLE market:
  - Improve quality score (β=0.000183): +1 quality → +0.000183 rpad
  - Crash rate has minimal impact (β=0.000270)
  - Model R² = 0.0958

DECLINING market:
  - Improve quality score (β=0.000075): +1 quality → +0.000075 rpad
  - Crash rate has minimal impact (β=0.000142)
  - Model R² = 0.1560
